SUMMARY:POTAWATOMI PARK SUMMER CONCERT SERIES
LOCATION:Potawatomi Park | 500 S. Greenlawn Ave | South Bend\, IN 46615
DESCRIPTION:Indulge in the vibrant sounds of summer and join us at our FREE
  Summer Concert Series at Potawatomi Park! Each Sunday evening (6-8pm) fr
 om June to September\, you’ll have a chance to enjoy live music\, fun c
 ommunity nights\, and rotating food trucks with your friends and family 
 – just bring a blanket or chair and your Sunday evening plans are set! 
 The performer lineup is as follows:\n\n- June 14 – Mr. Z\n- June 21 –
  PT and the Cruisers\n- June 28 – Kennedy Kitchen\n- July 5 – Brian M
 ach\n- July 12 – Michiana String Collective\n- July 19 – Hipposonics\
 n- July 26 – Left Side of the Dial\n- August 2 – The Resurrection Blu
 es Band\n- August 9 – Now & Then\n- August 16 – SBSO Summer Concert S
 eries\n- August 23 – Paul Zulas\n- August 30 – Soul Discovery\n- Sept
 ember 6 – Los Luna Latin Band\n- September 13 – Van Dyke Revue\n\nSee
  you there!\n\nPLEASE NOTE: newly constructed parking spaces are now avai
 lable at Potawatomi Park on Wall Street – please utilize these spaces a
 nd refrain from parking in the neighborhoods as much as possible.\n\nMore
  Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/potawatomi-park-summer-conce
 rt-series/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/potawatomi-park-summer-concert-se
 ries/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260906T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260906T200000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
