SUMMARY:WUBU MIXER - ALL WHITE PARTY
LOCATION:The Island at The Century Center | 120 South Doctor Martin Luther 
 King Junior Boulevard | South Bend\, IN 46601
DESCRIPTION:All White Party featuring Lepolion\, and The Godfather\, Gino J
 \n\nGet ready to dress to impress and experience a night of music\, fashi
 on\, and unforgettable entertainment at WUBU’s Mixer – All White Part
 y\, happening Friday\, September 4 from 7–11 PM. Doors open at 6:30 PM!
 \n\nPresented alongside The New Mix 102.3\, this exclusive evening brings
  together style\, culture\, and incredible live entertainment — all wit
 h an all-white dress code.\n\nLive Entertainment:\n\nGet ready for an unf
 orgettable performance from Lepolion\, featuring their high-energy tribut
 e to two music legends — Michael Jackson and Prince! Dance\, sing along
 \, and relive the hits that made these icons unforgettable.\n\nSpecial Gu
 est: The Godfather Himself — Gino J!\n\nYou never know what’s in stor
 e when the Godfather steps into the room!\n\nWUBU’s Mixer – All White
  Party is where the dress code is white\, the energy is elevated\, and th
 e night is all about celebrating music\, and community.\n\nMore Info: htt
 ps://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/wubu-mixer-all-white-party/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/wubu-mixer-all-white-party/
